  * func_80AB3E10 -> EnNb_WaitTalkEndAfterPath
    deduced, confidence HIGH: the last step: body-tracks the player until
    the textbox closes

  * D_80AB4318 -> sCsRunning
    deduced, confidence HIGH: overlay-wide latch that a cutscene was
    running, so its end can be detected on the next update

